{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the years of the life of Levi, etc.</b> Why were the years of Levi counted? To make known how many were the years of the enslavement — for as long as one of the tribes was alive, there was no enslavement (Shemot Rabbah 1), as it says ״וַיָּמָת יוֹסֵף וְכָל אֶחָיו״ (Exodus 1), and afterwards ״וַיָּקָם מֶלֶךְ חָדָשׁ״ — and Levi outlived them all."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:47.133106302Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}